nt requests)(Hmm, you could even make it non- or less abusable by inflicting a majormoney penalty (half of bank balance) when people make use of that crashrecovery thing)Anyhow, the list of eq that I lost:flail (monk in Jerusalem)shield (tyrael in Paladins)burning bracers (used to be Leornic eq in Paladins but can't find it onany mob nowadays anymore)ranger boots (ranger guy in forest has them)(could also have been avenger boots (without that rusty thing) I'll have tocheck)leggings (leb-kamar has them), and 2 times leb-kamar ringthick brown belt (from man in sewer of jerusalem)plate mail (leb-kamar has it)steel gauntlets (of tyrael)tyraels shining robes (also of course tyreal)(i had sold my necklace, so i didn't wear at neck item ...) (i think)crown of decay (liveone in darvox tower has it0(damn, could also have been goggles) can't remember if i was using mystr-set or my dex-set ...checked my logs it was the dex-set, so i didn't have necklace item,boots were avenger ranger boots, and head was crown of decayWell that list should be complete now .. I think I'll automate theprocess next time .. constantly logging the exact set when i startto wear one ...Thanks for the efforts and I heart that Irmeli will only be I as soonas friday.Cheers, Drude**Rag**Subj: eqDate: Sep 21I was just wondering, do I get my eq back someday?This mud rocks! Thanks. :)**Gheldor**Subj: Castlet...Date: Sep 28Mä voisin ottaa noi castlet duunin alle sittenkin... olis vaan mukava saadaoikeat /castle dirriin plus save_object() funcci toimii vaikkapa /castle/savedirriin...++GheldorPs. Aattelin laittaa peliin myös special castlet jotka toimii housen tyylillä,    mutta siihen pitää saada eka invit sellaselta jolla on jo accessi sinne. =)**Gheldor**Subj: Pari banni requestii...Cc: celtronDate: Oct  3Ab:n hosti (193.143.78.7):sta tuli eilen joku 3 jätkää jotka eka vittuilija sitten alko tulee sumee spammi... Spammaajat oli just näitä Ab/